<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FOAMed Made Microlearning Scalable</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            position: relative;
        }

        .shell {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .content-layer {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            z-index: 2;
            padding: 120px 140px 180px 140px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .header-group {
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 68px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0A192F;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #4A5568;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .citation {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #718096;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-left: 12px;
            transform: translateY(-8px);
        }

        .figure-container {
            flex-grow: 1;
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .takeaway-box {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding: 24px 32px;
            background-color: #F7FAFC;
            border-left: 6px solid #C41230;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            max-width: 1200px;
        }

        .takeaway-text {
            font-size: 26px;
            color: #2D3748;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .takeaway-text strong {
            color: #0A192F;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* SVG Styles */
        .node-bg { fill: #ffffff; stroke: #E2E8F0; stroke-width: 2; }
        .node-text { fill: #0A192F; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; font-family: sans-serif; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: middle; }
        .link-line { fill: none; stroke: #CBD5E0; stroke-width: 3; stroke-linecap: round; }
        .link-line-dashed { fill: none; stroke: #A0AEC0; stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 6 6; stroke-linecap: round; }

        .hub-circle { fill: #0055A4; }
        .hub-text { fill: #ffffff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; font-family: sans-serif; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: middle; }

        .dot-blue { fill: #0055A4; }
        .dot-navy { fill: #0A192F; }
        .dot-red { fill: #C41230; }
        .dot-gray { fill: #A0AEC0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Required Background Image -->
    <img class="shell" src="../../../../templates/saem-annual-meeting-template-v1/template.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

    <!-- Content Layer -->
    <div class="content-layer">

        <div class="header-group">
            <h1>FOAMed made microlearning scalable.</h1>
            <h2>Emergency medicine already has a delivery ecosystem. <span class="citation">[2, 5, 15, 29]</span></h2>
        </div>

        <div class="figure-container">
            <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 1640 480">

                <!-- Connections from Hub to Channels -->
                <path class="link-line" d="M 280 240 C 400 240, 400 90, 520 90" />
                <path class="link-line" d="M 280 240 C 400 240, 400 190, 520 190" />
                <path class="link-line" d="M 280 240 C 400 240, 400 290, 520 290" />
                <path class="link-line" d="M 280 240 C 400 240, 400 390, 520 390" />

                <!-- Connections from Channels to Network -->
                <!-- Blogs -->
                <path class="link-line-dashed" d="M 780 90 C 900 90, 950 50, 1050 50" />
                <path class="link-line-dashed" d="M 780 90 C 900 90, 950 120, 1080 120" />
                <!-- Podcasts -->
                <path class="link-line-dashed" d="M 780 190 C 900 190, 920 160, 1020 160" />
                <path class="link-line-dashed" d="M 780 190 C 900 190, 950 220, 1100 220" />
                <!-- Videos -->
                <path class="link-line-dashed" d="M 780 290 C 900 290, 930 260, 1060 260" />
                <path class="link-line-dashed" d="M 780 290 C 900 290, 960 320, 1040 320" />
                <!-- Curated Modules -->
                <path class="link-line-dashed" d="M 780 390 C 900 390, 940 360, 1090 360" />
                <path class="link-line-dashed" d="M 780 390 C 900 390, 950 430, 1050 430" />

                <!-- Deep Network Connections -->
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1050" y1="50" x2="1200" y2="80" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1080" y1="120" x2="1250" y2="100" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1080" y1="120" x2="1180" y2="180" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1020" y1="160" x2="1150" y2="140" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1100" y1="220" x2="1280" y2="200" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1100" y1="220" x2="1220" y2="280" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1060" y1="260" x2="1300" y2="250" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1040" y1="320" x2="1180" y2="340" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1090" y1="360" x2="1260" y2="320" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1090" y1="360" x2="1240" y2="400" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1050" y1="430" x2="1190" y2="420" />

                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1200" y1="80" x2="1380" y2="60" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1250" y1="100" x2="1420" y2="130" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1180" y1="180" x2="1350" y2="160" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1280" y1="200" x2="1450" y2="220" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1220" y1="280" x2="1390" y2="290" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1300" y1="250" x2="1480" y2="240" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1260" y1="320" x2="1440" y2="340" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1240" y1="400" x2="1410" y2="380" />
                <line class="link-line-dashed" x1="1190" y1="420" x2="1360" y2="440" />

                <!-- Hub Node -->
                <circle class="hub-circle" cx="160" cy="240" r="110" />
                <text class="hub-text" x="160" y="230">FOAMed</text>
                <text class="hub-text" x="160" y="265" style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.9;">Ecosystem</text>

                <!-- Channel Nodes -->
                <g transform="translate(520, 50)">
                    <rect class="node-bg" x="0" y="0" width="260" height="80" rx="12" />
                    <text class="node-text" x="130" y="40">blogs</text>
                </g>
                <g transform="translate(520, 150)">
                    <rect class="node-bg" x="0" y="0" width="260" height="80" rx="12" />
                    <text class="node-text" x="130" y="40">podcasts</text>
                </g>
                <g transform="translate(520, 250)">
                    <rect class="node-bg" x="0" y="0" width="260" height="80" rx="12" />
                    <text class="node-text" x="130" y="40">videos</text>
                </g>
                <g transform="translate(520, 350)">
                    <rect class="node-bg" x="0" y="0" width="260" height="80" rx="12" />
                    <text class="node-text" x="130" y="40">curated modules</text>
                </g>

                <!-- Network Dots (Distributed Scale) -->
                <!-- Layer 1 -->
                <circle class="dot-blue" cx="1050" cy="50" r="8" />
                <circle class="dot-navy" cx="1080" cy="120" r="10" />
                <circle class="dot-gray" cx="1020" cy="160" r="6" />
                <circle class="dot-blue" cx="1100" cy="220" r="12" />
                <circle class="dot-navy" cx="1060" cy="260" r="8" />
                <circle class="dot-gray" cx="1040" cy="320" r="7" />
                <circle class="dot-red" cx="1090" cy="360" r="9" />
                <circle class="dot-blue" cx="1050" cy="430" r="8" />

                <!-- Layer 2 -->
                <circle class="dot-navy" cx="1200" cy="80" r="10" />
                <circle class="dot-blue" cx="1250" cy="100" r="14" />
                <circle class="dot-red" cx="1180" cy="180" r="8" />
                <circle class="dot-gray" cx="1150" cy="140" r="6" />
                <circle class="dot-navy" cx="1280" cy="200" r="12" />
                <circle class="dot-blue" cx="1220" cy="280" r="9" />
                <circle class="dot-gray" cx="1300" cy="250" r="7" />
                <circle class="dot-navy" cx="1180" cy="340" r="10" />
                <circle class="dot-blue" cx="1260" cy="320" r="12" />
                <circle class="dot-gray" cx="1240" cy="400" r="8" />
                <circle class="dot-red" cx="1190" cy="420" r="6" />

                <!-- Layer 3 -->
                <circle class="dot-gray" cx="1380" cy="60" r="6" />
                <circle class="dot-navy" cx="1420" cy="130" r="10" />
                <circle class="dot-blue" cx="1350" cy="160" r="8" />
                <circle class="dot-red" cx="1450" cy="220" r="12" />
                <circle class="dot-gray" cx="1390" cy="290" r="7" />
                <circle class="dot-navy" cx="1480" cy="240" r="9" />
                <circle class="dot-blue" cx="1440" cy="340" r="11" />
                <circle class="dot-gray" cx="1410" cy="380" r="6" />
                <circle class="dot-navy" cx="1360" cy="440" r="8" />

            </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="takeaway-box">
            <p class="takeaway-text"><strong>Takeaway:</strong> FOAMed enabled distributed, timely microlearning at scale, but <em>delivery</em> is not the same thing as <em>validation</em>.</p>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
